{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":207700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"route","t":2602.521474,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":9851.501522,"text":"Doch nach dem Verlust des Tors des Kapitäns erzielte Indien nur 36 Runden und verlor sieben Tore, womit die Innings beendet waren."},{"kind":"text","t":10237.104829,"text":"But after losing their wicket captain, India scored only 36 runs and lost seven wickets, ending the innings. "},{"kind":"audio","t":10293.704842000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10295.614527,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10296.809956000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10298.036242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10300.934866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":10302.369646000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":10302.600333,"samples":6192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":11601.625279,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":19849.788065,"text":"Sie haben normalerweise ein besonderes Angebot an Speisen, Getränken und Unterhaltung, um die Gäste bei Laune zu halten und dafür zu sorgen, dass sie bleiben."},{"kind":"text","t":20207.71463,"text":"They usually have a special offer of food, drinks, and entertainment to keep guests happy and ensure they stay. "},{"kind":"audio","t":20259.764233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":20261.119924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":20262.786592,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20264.699963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20266.375435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20267.202089,"samples":20360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"route","t":22401.911342,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":29240.478214,"text":"Del Potro hatte im zweiten Satz einen frühen Vorteil, doch auch diesmal war ein Tie-Break erforderlich, nachdem das 6 zu 6 erreicht wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":29682.54526,"text":"Del Potro took an early lead in the second set, but once again a tie-break was needed after it reached 6-6. "},{"kind":"audio","t":29732.270263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29733.727557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29735.305062,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29737.106674,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29738.85795,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29739.725917,"samples":22160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"route","t":33301.526289999994,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":41601.414561,"text":"Das Internet verbindet sowohl Elemente der Massenkommunikation als auch der zwischenmenschlichen Kommunikation."},{"kind":"text","t":41825.963385999996,"text":"The Internet combines elements of mass communication as well as interpersonal communication. "},{"kind":"audio","t":41872.036622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41873.435909,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":41875.087504999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41876.818561,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41878.634084,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":41878.783008,"samples":7160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":43401.31469,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"route","t":46401.315179,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":53822.278550999996,"text":"The composition of these crystals matches the composition found in the urine of the affected pets. "},{"kind":"audio","t":53867.774328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53869.230919999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53871.03773,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53872.88183599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53874.558379999995,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"input","t":55065.844361999996,"text":"Die Zusammensetzung dieser Kristalle entspricht der Zusammensetzung, die im Urin betroffene Haustiere gefunden wurden, wenn man sie mittels Infrarotspektropos bedacht."},{"kind":"text","t":55239.960407,"text":"when examined using an infrared spectrometer. "},{"kind":"audio","t":55284.426523999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55286.003388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55287.070714999994,"samples":25664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"route","t":57401.26842099999,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":62763.170556,"text":"On some routes, larger companies use their own aircraft. "},{"kind":"audio","t":62806.289756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":62807.447469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62809.325756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":62809.4678,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":64640.357669,"text":"Auf einigen Routen setzen die größeren Firmen ihre eigenen Flugzeuge ein, aber auf anderen Routen und bei kleineren Firmen traten Schwierigkeiten auf."},{"kind":"text","t":64852.90327399999,"text":"But on other routes and with smaller companies, difficulties arose. "},{"kind":"audio","t":64896.534934999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64898.011567999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64900.022445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64900.485482,"samples":21096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"route","t":66601.69620800001,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":72107.377402,"text":"Manche Atome haben instabile Kerne, was bedeutet, dass sie schon bei geringem oder gar keinem Anstoß zerfallen."},{"kind":"text","t":72401.288371,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means they decay even with minimal or no external stimulus. "},{"kind":"audio","t":72449.310951,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72450.82149500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":72452.50553000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72454.27729700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":72456.089796,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72457.083071,"samples":23360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"route","t":75501.98126700001,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":86924.438866,"text":"Im selben Monat schoss ein weiteres Passagierflugzeug über das Ende einer Landebahn in Mashhad hinaus und stieß mit einer Mauer zusammen."},{"kind":"text","t":87293.13448200001,"text":"That same month, another passenger plane flew off the end of a runway in Mashhad and collided with a wall. "},{"kind":"audio","t":87340.642208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":87342.28174600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":87344.03836,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87345.755115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":87347.45682600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":320,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87348.35406700001,"samples":21560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"route","t":87348.45446800001,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":89385.521275,"text":"wobei 17 Menschen ums Leben kamen."},{"kind":"text","t":89565.02081500001,"text":"17 people lost their lives in the incident. "},{"kind":"audio","t":89608.277231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89610.013074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89610.594289,"samples":22664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"route","t":91802.240021,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"route","t":94101.148611,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":103238.04383000001,"text":"Fast alle sind Sandstrände mit sicheren Bademöglichkeiten und die meisten bieten Schatten, der von Pohutukawa-Bäumen gespendet wird."},{"kind":"text","t":103588.419819,"text":"Almost all are sandy beaches with safe swimming conditions, and most provide shade from pohutukawa trees. "},{"kind":"audio","t":103636.82524600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103638.55846500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103639.992904,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":103641.692463,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103643.51410500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103644.239657,"samples":19760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"route","t":105502.222991,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":114743.792321,"text":"Zu den beliebten Sportarten gehören Fußball, Basketball, Volleyball, Wasserball, Fechten, Rugby, Radfahren, Eishockey, Rollhockey und Formel 1 Motorsport."},{"kind":"text","t":115205.017746,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby, cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and Formula 1 racing. "},{"kind":"audio","t":115259.32136300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115260.860109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115262.516613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115264.190602,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115265.930932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115267.66212800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115269.477231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115271.12996800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"audio","t":115271.293044,"samples":56,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":116401.77979100001,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":122297.880453,"text":"Im warmen Klima des Mittleren Ostens kamen Häusern keine so große Bedeutung zu."},{"kind":"text","t":122578.650419,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, houses did not hold such great significance. "},{"kind":"audio","t":122624.718268,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122626.63515300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":122628.011705,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122629.776973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122630.06392500001,"samples":14128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"route","t":123800.699901,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":131208.04135699998,"text":"The archipelago is located 120 km north of the peninsula. "},{"kind":"audio","t":131252.18711199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131253.719789,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131255.49030399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131257.297585,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":131257.475193,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":131427.472338,"text":"Der Archipel liegt 120 km nördlich der Halbinsel. Die größte ist King George Island mit der Siedlung Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"text","t":131691.913534,"text":"The largest is King George Island, with the settlement of Villa Las Estrellas. "},{"kind":"audio","t":131735.78448499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131737.130411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":131738.88704499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131740.679554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":131740.817812,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":132602.522588,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":138203.13533699999,"text":"Der Kohlsaft ändert seine Farbe, je nachdem wie sauer oder basisch alkalisch die Chemikalie ist."},{"kind":"text","t":138549.643142,"text":"The color of the cabbage juice changes depending on whether the chemical is acidic or basic/alkaline. "},{"kind":"audio","t":138595.075083,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138596.396152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138598.18829999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138599.98675699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138601.70590499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":138602.095952,"samples":12560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":139101.927383,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":146234.68779899998,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to begin full operation in September 2017. "},{"kind":"audio","t":146279.47177499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146280.884471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146282.80088599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146284.363268,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":146284.74128699998,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147650.608995,"text":"Die Brücke soll im September 2017 vollständig den Betrieb aufnehmen. Es wird erwartet, dass die brasilianischen Zollpunkte dann fertiggestellt sein werden."},{"kind":"text","t":147886.967978,"text":"It is expected that the Brazilian customs checkpoints will be completed by then. "},{"kind":"audio","t":147930.242121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147931.871283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147933.678754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147935.400987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"audio","t":147935.524282,"samples":928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":149601.970847,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":158729.702111,"text":"Die Feuchtigkeit auf ihren Händen reagiert mit den äußeren Schichten, was sich komisch anfühlt und eine Art Schutzschicht bildet."},{"kind":"text","t":159095.741858,"text":"The moisture on their hands reacts with the outer layers, which feels strange and forms a kind of protective layer. "},{"kind":"audio","t":159142.938806,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159144.193014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159145.782236,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159150.51590199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159151.301395,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159151.572643,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"route","t":160201.741304,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":164522.023968,"text":"Eine Bombe explodierte vor dem Bürogebäude des Generalgouverneurs."},{"kind":"text","t":164755.119989,"text":"A bomb exploded in front of the governor-general’s office building. "},{"kind":"audio","t":164800.959363,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164802.79944399997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164804.188645,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":164804.795548,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"route","t":166201.939388,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":170612.777179,"text":"The Moroccan sultan rebuilt the city as Daelbeda. "},{"kind":"audio","t":170652.212453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170653.975007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170655.92309899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":170656.02982,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":173561.380568,"text":"Der marokkanische Sultan baute die Stadt als Daelbeda wieder auf und sie wurde von spanischen Händlern, die dort Handelsstützpunkte einrichteten, Casablanca genannt."},{"kind":"text","t":173835.692603,"text":"It was named Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading posts there. "},{"kind":"audio","t":173881.635123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173883.18208099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173884.93058299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173886.746136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":173887.130755,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":175501.991605,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":186857.72091399998,"text":"Er wurde von Wong Kang-Seng, dem stellvertretenden Premierminister Singapurs, begrüßt und sprach mit Lee Hsing-Long, dem Premierminister Singapurs,"},{"kind":"text","t":187309.27860599998,"text":"He was greeted by Wong Kang-Seng, Singapore’s Deputy Prime Minister, and spoke with Lee Hsing-Long, Singapore’s Prime Minister. "},{"kind":"audio","t":187359.384854,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187360.945774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":187362.620605,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187364.296488,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187366.059131,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187367.794994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187369.456676,"samples":32592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"route","t":187369.575985,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":187788.869909,"text":"über Handels- und Terrorismusangelegenheiten."},{"kind":"text","t":187911.523035,"text":"on trade and terrorism issues. "},{"kind":"audio","t":187951.56257799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187953.119782,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":187953.282698,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":189801.33755599998,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":200890.57567299998,"text":"Die Atombombe basiert auf dem Prinzip, dass man Energie benötigt."},{"kind":"text","t":201114.612727,"text":"The atomic bomb is based on the principle that energy is required. "},{"kind":"audio","t":201157.15207299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201158.76421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201160.475286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201161.36906099998,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"route","t":201301.06767699998,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":201968.413966,"text":"um einen Kern mit vielen Protonen und Neutronen zusammenzusetzen."},{"kind":"text","t":202171.43113799999,"text":"to form a nucleus with many protons and neutrons. "},{"kind":"audio","t":202213.73935599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202215.21816299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202216.820374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":202217.014416,"samples":1896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":203601.768655,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":207307.20520199998,"text":"Für die Archipel und Seen brauchen Sie nicht unbedingt eine Yacht."},{"kind":"text","t":207556.658156,"text":"You don’t necessarily need a yacht for the archipelagos and lakes. "},{"kind":"audio","t":207597.579546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207599.185634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":207600.87417599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":207601.073346,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":217703.437763,"code":1005}]}